# Vermilion City (FireRed's MUS_VERMILLION, which the city, its rooms and Route 11's gate share): a breezy harbour
# town in G, a trumpet tune with a lilting skip over a rolling bass, gulls of flute above it. Original composition
# for this game (plan 19 · K4).
